# A conversation working in its own worktree reviews that worktree's changes,
# not the project folder's.
# iOS: testSimulatorReviewsTheOpenSessionsWorktree
fixture /worktree-conversation/review
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Worktree conversation" 20000
expect "History for Worktree conversation" 20000
expect "1件のファイル"
press 変更を表示
expect "+Session worktree first" after ツールを追加 20000
expect "-original" after ツールを追加
expect_absent "Project-only change"
screenshot review
